### Analyze a feed (should succeed)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/matches/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "match": { "battingTeam": "India", "bowlingTeam": "New Zealand", "maxOvers": 20 },
  "tokens": ["1", "4", "wd", "W", "0", "nb", "2"]
}

### Analyze a feed with a bad token (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/matches/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "match": { "battingTeam": "India", "bowlingTeam": "New Zealand", "maxOvers": 20 },
  "tokens": ["1", "x"]
}